WEBVTT

00:01:59.303 --> 00:02:01.839
and preaches that
temperatures are going up

00:02:01.863 --> 00:02:05.293
because we forgot to bring
a reusable bag to the store.

00:02:05.665 --> 00:02:08.744
You taught me that taking care
of Mother Earth

00:02:08.768 --> 00:02:11.888
is about every decision
that we make as a collective.

00:02:13.109 --> 00:02:15.369
I am happy to tell you, Abuelita,

00:02:15.393 --> 00:02:18.364
that I changed everybody's
mind in that club.

00:02:18.388 --> 00:02:20.936
Instead of talking about recycling,

00:02:20.960 --> 00:02:23.730
we started to write letters
to our politicians

00:02:23.754 --> 00:02:26.079
to ban soft plastic altogether.

00:02:26.498 --> 00:02:29.266
And then, the unexpected happened:

00:02:29.871 --> 00:02:32.213
we started striking from school.